A large negative inventory already exists: **419 campaign-level plus 74 ad-group-level negatives on campaign 700072710** (`research/live-keywords-negatives-2026-07-12.md`). The task is therefore not building a list from scratch but **auditing the existing 493 negatives** for overblocking, staleness (many single-name/person negatives suggest long accumulation) and gaps around the confirmed waste terms (certificate-intent and regulator queries from the 2026-07-12 search-terms pull).

New candidates must be validated against actual Search Terms Reports. Use Exact negatives for specific irrelevant searches and Phrase negatives for clearly irrelevant intent patterns. Do not use speculative broad-match negatives.

Apply to **ErgoWorks Consulting campaigns only**, not account-wide.

