The **provisional** learning check is **5 × A$84.92 = A$424.60** per ad set, based on the assumption-labeled Snapshot-request CPA anchor. It is not independently assessable until a real post-cleanup CPA exists. The independent **A$20/day delivery floor = A$600 per 30 days** is the only verified sufficiency check and therefore the controlling minimum.

