If any mandatory gate fails, keep PMax `16143562968` parked.

## Proposed remarketing decision

The existing Display Remarketing campaign `843760968` should remain parked initially. First build isolated, consented audiences from:

- Consulting-site visitors;
- dedicated landing-page visitors;
- service-page visitors;
- form starters who did not submit;
- approved video viewers and social engagers;
- Snapshot page visitors;
- existing leads and customers for exclusion.

Activate paid remarketing only when audience size is sufficient, frequency can be controlled, creative is approved, conversion tracking is clean and it has funding separate from PMax’s A$50/day floor. Do not mix ErgoEquip or Physiotherapy audiences into Consulting remarketing.

## Proposed Meta build sheet

Creative concepts and executions live in Appendix D and are not duplicated here.

### Proposed account and campaign structure

| Level | Proposed build |
|---|---|
| Business scope | Dedicated ErgoWorks Consulting Pixel/Dataset, verified domain and Consulting-only GA4/GTM scope |
| Campaign | `META_CONV_Prospecting-[APPROVED-GEO]_[APPROVED-GEO]_2026Q3` — placeholder only; replace both geo tokens after service-geography sign-off and before build |
| Objective | Leads using the website conversion location |
